    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I reproduced this on latest version of the `main` branch\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.11.x\n\n### Description\n\nDid a fresh install (OpenSUSE Tumbleweed, KDE, Neovim 0.11).\nAfter initial startup, I get the starter window (OK).\nThen, when I open a file - any file - I get a Treesitter error.\n\nAfter pressing <Enter> I can continue using Neovim.\n\n### Reproduction\n\n```Error in decoration provider \"win\" (ns=nvim.treesitter.highlighter):\nError executing lua: /usr/share/nvim/runtime/lua/vim/treesitter/highlighter.lua:273: /usr/share/nvim/runtime/lua/vim/treesitter/query.lua:373: Query error at 257:3. Impossible pattern:\n(parameter) @keyword)\n^\n\nstack traceback:\n[C]: in function 'error'\n/usr/share/nvim/runtime/lua/vim/treesitter/highlighter.lua:273: in function 'get_query'\n/usr/share/nvim/runtime/lua/vim/treesitter/highlighter.lua:216: in function 'fn'\n/usr/share/nvim/runtime/lua/vim/treesitter/languagetree.lua:650: in function 'for_each_tree'\n/usr/share/nvim/runtime/lua/vim/treesitter/languagetree.lua:654: in function 'for_each_tree'\n/usr/share/nvim/runtime/lua/vim/treesitter/highlighter.lua:203: in function 'prepare_highlight_states'\n/usr/share/nvim/runtime/lua/vim/treesitter/highlighter.lua:534: in function </usr/share/nvim/runtime/lua/vim/treesitter/highlighter.lua:517>\n[C]: in function 'nvim__redraw'\n.../minimax/site/pack/deps/start/mini.nvim/lua/mini/git.lua```\n",
