            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\n\nHmm... It might have to do with Neovim installation. Could you please give more details about:\n- Which file *exactly* did you try to open to have this error message? For example, could you please try opening 'init.lua' (type `<Space>ei`) and posting the error (even if it is the same)?\n- Could you run `:checkhealth vim.treesitter` to see if there are any reported issues?\n- Could you run `:checkhealth nvim-treesitter` to see if there are any reported issues?\n- Could you please double check the Neovim version (including patch version, like 0.11.5). Run `:version` and see the result.",
